    answer: 'A security tender should explain the specific guarding or patrol activity, who is competent to perform it and how incidents reach an accountable decision-maker. Map licence evidence to roles rather than claiming that one licence type covers every proposed activity. The staffing plan and contract boundaries need separate approval.',
