    fieldHelp: ['Match each activity to the relevant evidence and expiry.', 'Identify shifts, reserve coverage and capacity confirmation.', 'Record the incident reference and approved communication path.', 'Name the responsible role, not public personal contact details.', 'Link training relevant to the activity and date.', 'State excluded duties and who approves changes.'],
